'''Jooks''' was a [[Gender|female]] [[Theelin]] who resided on the ''[[Colossus]]'' refueling station on [[Castilon]] in the later stages of the [[Cold War]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]]. She was a regular at [[Z'Vk'Thkrkza|Aunt Z's]] [[Aunt Z's Tavern|tavern]].<ref name="Recruit" />

==Biography==
When [[Kazuda Xiono]] first visited [[Aunt Z's Tavern]], [[Glem]] was just telling Jooks about Kazuda's reputation as both of them entered the establishment. Shortly thereafter a brawl ensued, in which Jooks picked a fight with [[Yani]]. She was positioned on [[Narb]]'s back when [[Jarek Yeager]] ordered an end to the fight.<ref name="Recruit" />

The next morning, before the race between Kazuda and [[Torra Doza]], Jooks appeared to have spend the night in the open air on the deck of the ''Colossus'', awakening next to a barrel together with [[Narb]].<ref name="Recruit" />

When Xiono found himself in a precarious situation on the outside ledges of [[Doza Tower]], his plight was clearly visible from Aunt Z's Tavern. Jooks bet 60 [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]] that Xiono would fall off.<ref name="The High Tower">{{Resistance|The High Tower}}</ref>

==Personality and traits==
Jooks was a female Theelin with [[Color|magenta]] [[hair]] and spotted pink skin.<ref name="Recruit" />

==Behind the scenes==
Jooks first appeared in the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' episode "[[The Recruit]]," voiced by [[Mary Elizabeth McGlynn]].<ref name="Recruit" />

